- [1Password](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/integrations/1password.md): Securely inject 1Password secrets into your browser sessions
- [Volumes](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/advanced/volumes.md): Persistent storage that follows your browser sessions
- [Bring Your Own Keys (BYOK)](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/advanced/bring-your-own-key.md): Use your own LLM provider keys to power AI-driven browser automations
- [File Upload](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/advanced/file-upload.md)
- [File Download](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/advanced/file-download.md)
- [P2P Download](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/advanced/p2p-downloads.md): Receive download events in real time and fetch files directly from the browser
- [Webhooks](https://docs.anchorbrowser.io/webhooks/overview.md): Receive real-time notifications when tasks, sessions and identities complete, fail, or need human input.
